{"3962800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eclipsed Realms", "steam_appid": 3962800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eclipsed Realms</strong> is an action-adventure game set across two parallel dimensions, where your choices and puzzle-solving skills shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features and content included:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two explorable realms:</strong> Switch between two nearly identical worlds to solve environment-based puzzles, unlock hidden paths, and uncover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted main region:</strong> Explore a meticulously designed area featuring varied terrain, interactive objects, and early combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles:</strong> Use your realm-shifting ability to manipulate objects, create bridges, and overcome obstacles that exist differently in each dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat mechanics:</strong> Engage with enemies using strategic combat that changes depending on the realm you occupy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intro story sequence:</strong> Discover the origins of the realm-splitting event and your newfound power, setting the stage for deeper exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and lore:</strong> Find hidden notes, artifacts, and clues that reveal the rich backstory of the realms</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eclipsed Realms</strong> is an action-adventure game set across two parallel dimensions, where your choices and puzzle-solving skills shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features and content included:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two explorable realms:</strong> Switch between two nearly identical worlds to solve environment-based puzzles, unlock hidden paths, and uncover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted main region:</strong> Explore a meticulously designed area featuring varied terrain, interactive objects, and early combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles:</strong> Use your realm-shifting ability to manipulate objects, create bridges, and overcome obstacles that exist differently in each dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat mechanics:</strong> Engage with enemies using strategic combat that changes depending on the realm you occupy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intro story sequence:</strong> Discover the origins of the realm-splitting event and your newfound power, setting the stage for deeper exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and lore:</strong> Find hidden notes, artifacts, and clues that reveal the rich backstory of the realms</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Journey through fractured realms in a rich, immersive world. Solve intricate puzzles, battle deadly foes, and uncover lost lore. Teleport between parallel realities to alter environments, unlock secrets, and conquer challenges across shifting, surreal landscapes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962800/d0646df5342f4db58b5aae4ded37e5dd517c84da/header.jpg?t=1767641242", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962800/9c8bd3805a1696f8b23a72edec6af728dcd480a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767641242", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962800/9c8bd3805a1696f8b23a72edec6af728dcd480a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767641242", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>M